    {
      "text": "I-2-أ) بين أنه لكل \\(x\\in\\mathbb{R}\\): \\(f'(x)=x(x-2)e^{1-x}\\).",
      "solution": {
        "strategy": "نشتق الحد \\(-x^2e^{1-x}\\) باستعمال مشتقة جداء.",
        "steps": [
          {
            "step_number": 1,
            "title": "الاشتقاق",
            "explanation": "\\[(x^2e^{1-x})'=2xe^{1-x}-x^2e^{1-x}=x(2-x)e^{1-x}.\\] ومنه \\[f'(x)=-x(2-x)e^{1-x}=x(x-2)e^{1-x}.\\]",
            "result": "\\(f'(x)=x(x-2)e^{1-x}\\)."
          }
        ],
        "final_answer": "\\(\\boxed{f'(x)=x(x-2)e^{1-x}}\\).",
